    "body": "## Summary\n\n**ADR-058 — `top: 50%` + `translateY(-50%)`.** Two commits:\n\n1. **`222fbe7`**: the two-layer implementation — `top: %` in absolute positioning + `transform: translateY()` paint support\n2. **New commit**: `PERF-CASCADE` / `PERF-LAYOUT` split timer in `relayout()` — infrastructure for ADR-059, no behavior change\n\n**Docs follow after merge.**\n\n## The magnifier chain closes\n\n| ADR | Contribution | Icon y |\n|---|---|---|\n| 054 | Diagnose `top: 50%` + `translateY(-50%)` | invisible |\n| 055 | `background:` color forms | invisible |\n| 056 | `background:` URL forms — **renders** | 7 |\n| 057 | `parent_content_height` threading | 7 |\n| **058** | **`top: 50%` + `translateY(-50%)`** | **18 (centered)** |\n\n**Screenshot verified 2026-11-02**: search magnifier at `y=18`, centered in the search box.\n\n## What ships\n\n### Layer 1: `top: %` in absolute positioning\n\n- `abs_ctx.parent_content_height = abs_ch` (1 line)\n- `parse_off` split into `parse_off_h` (left/right, width) and `parse_off_v` (top/bottom, height)\n- `bottom: %` works for free\n\n### Layer 2: `transform: translateY()` paint support\n\n- `LayoutBox::transform_translate_y = 0.0f`\n- Extract `translateY(...)` before `box.height` known, resolve after\n- Paint wrapper generalizes `did_rotate` → `did_transform` (rotate OR translate)\n\n### Layer 3: Split timer (this PR)\n\n- `PERF-CASCADE: X.Xms  PERF-LAYOUT: Y.Yms  PERF-TOTAL: Z.Zms` per relayout\n- Always-on to stderr\n- Diagnostic-only; zero behavior change\n\n## Verified delta\n\n**675 / 2586 all pass** (was 669 / 2562). 1 test flipped (`translateY(-50%)` now sets `translate_y`), 6 new ADR-058 tests.\n\n**Wikipedia screenshot**: search magnifier at `y=18` (was `y=7`). **The 5-ADR chain 054→055→056→057→058 closes with visible production proof.**\n\n## The split-timer measurement (ADR-059 foundation)\n\n**Wikipedia HTML article, Release build:**\n\n```\nPERF-CASCADE: 1057.9ms  PERF-LAYOUT: 2379.3ms  PERF-TOTAL: 3437.2ms\n```\n\n- Cascade 31% (1.06s), Layout 69% (2.38s)\n- **Both are O(n²)-ish** — no single fix\n- ADR-059 (perf cycle) will use this to isolate the biggest single win\n\n## Test count\n\n- 669 → 675 cases (+6)\n- 2562 → 2586 assertions (+24)\n- Zero existing test regressions\n\n## Deferred (documented in ADR-058 spec)\n\n- `translateX()` / 2-arg `translate()`\n- Combined `rotate + translate` source-order semantics\n- `bottom: %`, `left: %`, `right: %` (bottom works for free)\n\nRefs #255\n",
